title: With Match Whole Word on, Find and replace-all change foo but leave foofoo and food alone
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
forbid-log: nothing offers
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-file: edit-odd/words.txt :: (?-i)\nbar foofoo food\n

wait 3000
goto words.txt
wait 800
tool edit
edit words.txt 1 1
find-option word on
find foo
wait 300
mark word-on
wait 450
find replace-all bar
wait 500
mark replaced
wait 450
find close
key save
wait 800
quit
